    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/9b081e7a6217958c1ab3d4bfa9db7e82.avif?t=1746807585\" /></span><br>A spooky adventure where Vasilisa's journey and service to Baba Yaga consist of a series of mini-games with a variety of gameplay mechanics.<br><br>You will go on a journey with Vasilisa to the land of the dead to obtain the power of fire, which only Baba Yaga can give. Vasilisa already has a magical helper \u2014 a doll given by her mother. But this is not enough to deal with the evil stepmother. It is necessary to pass the tests of the mistress of the forbidden forest and prove to her that Vasilisa is worthy to receive the power not only from her mother, but the mother of all mothers \u2014 Baba Yaga.<br><br>On your way you will encounter:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f36d9efecdef7187479b920313fc51.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f36d9efecdef7187479b920313fc51.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f36d9efecdef7187479b920313fc51.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u0421ombat missions:<br>\u2022 fight petty evil spirits<br>\u2022 defeat the lord of the river Vodyanoy, lord of the swamp Bolotnik and lord of the forest Leshy (defeat the lords of the river, swamp and forest: Vodyanoy, Bolotnik and Leshy)<br>\u2022 prevail against the cruel stepmother<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/dfd56e26f897ca5017b4058b679e6b7e.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/dfd56e26f897ca5017b4058b679e6b7e.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/dfd56e26f897ca5017b4058b679e6b7e.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Household chores <br>\u2022 wash a mountain of dishes<br>\u2022 do a pile of laundry <br>\u2022 tidy up Baba Yaga's hut<br>\u2022 prepare the dough and bake some pirogi<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/6a17aad49fe956ff52f9d876b714f754.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/6a17aad49fe956ff52f9d876b714f754.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/6a17aad49fe956ff52f9d876b714f754.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tasks to test attentiveness <br>\u2022 escape the fog<br>\u2022 successfully leave the forest<br>\u2022 do not get lost in the algae<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/5f709bb14eeb6e89da8386ad24210199.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/5f709bb14eeb6e89da8386ad24210199.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/5f709bb14eeb6e89da8386ad24210199.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tasks to test dexterity <br>\u2022 sneak past a sleeping Vodyanoy without being caught<br>\u2022 creep quietly past Bolotnik without being found<br>\u2022 escape detection by Leshy<br>\u2022 flee From Baba Yaga <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/4d931fe0a9303d06f9ccb04c2186623e.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/4d931fe0a9303d06f9ccb04c2186623e.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/4d931fe0a9303d06f9ccb04c2186623e.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/ef5d7ba1408f3efa280a264fdb571c89.avif?t=1746807585\" /></span><br>\u2022 The game is based on unadapted versions of fairytales and folktales with elements of what is perceived in modern culture as horror.<br><br>\u2022 The narrator reads the tale in a South Russian dialect. The story is told in the same manner as in Russian villages.<br><br>\u2022 The soundtrack is an original piece based on folk songs from the central and southern parts of Russia.<br><br>\u2022 The built-in encyclopaedia of folk tale characters, demonic creatures, household items, customs and rituals was compiled with the help of a consulting folklorist.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/5641f10e6782eb2a9bfb570b996f2d2c.avif?t=1746807585\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/22456c6f9bf8d478775349e81ec69712.mp4?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/9b081e7a6217958c1ab3d4bfa9db7e82.avif?t=1746807585\" /></span><br>A spooky adventure where Vasilisa's journey and service to Baba Yaga consist of a series of mini-games with a variety of gameplay mechanics.<br><br>You will go on a journey with Vasilisa to the land of the dead to obtain the power of fire, which only Baba Yaga can give. Vasilisa already has a magical helper \u2014 a doll given by her mother. But this is not enough to deal with the evil stepmother. It is necessary to pass the tests of the mistress of the forbidden forest and prove to her that Vasilisa is worthy to receive the power not only from her mother, but the mother of all mothers \u2014 Baba Yaga.<br><br>On your way you will encounter:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f36d9efecdef7187479b920313fc51.poster.avif?t=1746807585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f36d9efecdef7187479b920313fc51.webm?t=1746807585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331070/extras/e2f